Attribution
------------
The temporal rule set implemented in this project was adapted from the
MapBiomas Brazil "deforestation and secondary vegetation" pipeline, as
published in https://github.com/felipefalexandre/brazil-deforestation-sec-vegetation
(Collection 11, commit ee9707a). That repository does not carry an explicit
license file; the rules originate from the MapBiomas project
(https://mapbiomas.org). This project reimplements the rules for local
processing and adds original code for input validation, windowed processing,
CLI, quality control and tests.
